},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]我之前在蛇腹矿坑订了一大批矿石，准备作为锻铁比赛用的素材，和瑟尔妲那家伙决一胜负。于是，我带着我的卫兵伙伴一起，亲自去把货物运回来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]结果运到一半的时候，一群天杀的芙洛波不知道从哪里冲了出来！[r]它们朝我们发动攻击，我们毫无还手之力！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]那群混账……不但把我们痛殴了一顿，抢走了我们买来的矿石，还对着那些它们拿不走的矿石……放屁！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_36"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]你懂我的意思吗，它们在那些矿石上，放、臭、屁！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]欸——[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":50,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]那可是我贷款买回来的矿石啊！那些它们拿不走的矿石，全被芙洛波的屁熏臭了！真的是太、过、分、了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]而且最可气的是……我实在没办法补货了，只好硬着头皮，拿着这批剩下的这些矿石参加第二天的锻造比赛……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"铸甲匠达尔曼","text":"[show]结果，不但第99次输给了瑟尔妲……还被煅炉里的所有人嘲笑：以后从达尔曼手上买护甲，还要先闻闻气味——！呜啊啊啊啊啊——！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": 